Package: ididPolicy
Type: Package
Title: Instrumented Difference-in-Differences Policy Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Author: iDID study authors
Maintainer: Ritoban Kundu <ritoban.kundu@pennmedicine.upenn.edu>
Description: Cross-fitted scoring, constrained linear policy learning, and
    value contrast estimation for recurrent events with a terminal event.
    Implements two inverse probability weighting estimators and the two-part
    augmented estimator. Supports user-specified landmarks and nuisance libraries.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: stats, SuperLearner, survival
Suggests: randomForestSRC, lightgbm, rgenoud
